          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-the-pipeline-and-its-contract\">2. The pipeline and its contract</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The decorator states the contract; the function body is ordinary Ibis.\nConditions are Ibis expressions over the output columns (<code>_.bpm</code>), and\n<code>sv.unique(...)</code> says the listed columns form a key.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>on_unproved=\"warn\"</code> lets the call go through with a warning when Lean\ncan't prove something; the default, <code>\"error\"</code>, refuses the pipeline, and\n<code>\"runtime\"</code> checks the unproved conditions on the actual output instead.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
