            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"what-is-trusted-what-is-proved\">What is trusted, what is proved</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Proved in Lean</strong>: the interval and NULL analysis behind every \u2705, the\n  key analysis behind <code>unique</code>, and that the delta plans compute exactly\n  the change to the view. Floats follow DataFusion's semantics bit for\n  bit, NaN and \u22120.0 included.</li>\n<li><strong>Trusted</strong>: the translation from DataFusion's Substrait JSON into the\n  Lean model, DataFusion itself, and the small amount of Python that\n  stores the view and merges changes. The intro notebook\n  (<code>notebooks/intro.py</code>) explains the formal side step by step.</li>\n</ul></span>"
